Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:15.96,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Kurumi Tokisaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:17.74,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:23.21,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:26.00,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You've finally left yourself vulnerable,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:28.91,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Isaac Westcott.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.67,0:02:21.49,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:25.05,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:27.00,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:32.50,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Artemisia! We're falling back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.25,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.34,0:02:45.50,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.93,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,How do you do, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.95,0:02:51.16,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What seems to be the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:53.74,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You're giving me quite the odd look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:55.05,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:57.74,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You mean you survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:03:00.57,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:05.41,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,The moment Mio stole my Sephirah from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.41,0:03:12.82,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I used Het to transfer my mind \Nand Sephirah to a clone I created.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:18.03,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Of course that required quite a bit \Nof preparation to achieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:19.40,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:25.18,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,You're currently a clone being possessed \Nby the real Kurumi's personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:27.54,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:29.63,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,More importantly right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:33.78,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel, Dalet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:41.78,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Finally, I've finally obtained it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:55.55,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's overflowing, it's overflowing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.38,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,So this is what having \Na second Sephirah is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:03.05,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I feel like I can do anything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:06.30,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:13.89,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:15.06,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:16.00,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:16.85,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:16.85,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.85,0:04:17.68,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:18.09,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:18.60,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:19.55,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:21.70,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we're late, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:26.97,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Kurumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.82,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Huh?! What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:33.90,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,I heard that DEM was attacking Darling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:40.66,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I took over the role of rescuing Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:42.59,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.09,0:04:48.19,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,it would seem an even more \Ntroublesome foe has to come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:52.10,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido, this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:54.87,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:57.60,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm sorry, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:05:03.79,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I still have much to learn, \Nletting myself fall for that diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:06.34,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Though I'm glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:08.69,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I thank you too, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:11.62,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You protected Shin for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:18.91,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,My, my, hearing thanks from you \Nonly brings up awful memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.73,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.73,0:05:25.35,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Mio is after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:28.45,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,So run away while we buy you some time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:30.16,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:34.56,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin and I already share a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.01,0:05:38.65,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I know what Shin experienced in the future, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:42.66,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,His means of returning to the past \Nwon't work anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.07,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:47.34,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Stop, she's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:48.94,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.65,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:56.79,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I couldn't seal away your Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:06:01.29,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You were in a half-state \Nwithout all the Sephirah, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.89,0:06:06.41,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But I know that wasn't the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:12.77,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I have to kiss a Spirit \Nafter she opens her heart to me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:14.21,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,in order to seal her Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:20.26,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But you still haven't opened your heart to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:22.51,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:24.68,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:28.93,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,In that moment her affection \Nwas definitely high enough to seal her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:29.97,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:30.75,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:33.49,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:36.26,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,The one Mio loves isn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:39.69,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,It's Shin. Shinji Takamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:42.75,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:47.46,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Shinji is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:52.95,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.01,0:06:57.77,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's why I recreated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:04.07,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I even granted you the power of Spirits \Nso you would never die this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:08.69,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, your power truly is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.07,0:07:14.23,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But even if I gathered all of the Sephirah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:18.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,and all of my memories \Nas Shido Itsuka vanished from my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:21.62,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,would I really be Shinji?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:26.37,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I would be a person that looks like Shinji \Nand possesses Shinji's memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:28.86,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,but that wouldn't be Shinji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.41,0:07:32.83,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Shinji's soul wouldn't be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:37.18,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm betting you already \Nunderstand that all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:41.13,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You understand that, \Nand yet you can't help but cling to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:47.44,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Though would that truly \Nsatisfy your heart, Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:55.49,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Why are you saying these things, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.23,0:07:58.65,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You're all I have, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:05.34,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I've lived my entire life \Nto see you once again, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:06.96,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:09.39,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You have me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:11.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,And you have all the Spirits, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:19.72,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Is the time we all spent together that \Ninferior to the time you spent with Shinji?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:25.26,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:29.57,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You're saying these things \Nbecause you're not Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:33.14,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I need to hurry and get Shin back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:36.85,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:38.12,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:40.99,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's time for our farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:44.29,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.79,0:08:46.72,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Thanks, you saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.00,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Don't mention it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:49.92,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Though what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:52.92,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm going to kiss Mio again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:54.17,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:55.94,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:59.50,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,You're the one who just said she \Ndidn't have enough affection for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:05.05,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Which is why this time, I have to make her \Nchoose me, Shido Itsuka, instead of Shinji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:08.17,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'm sure Mio will...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:12.03,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:15.65,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That was a close call, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:19.76,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,This position is a little embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:23.45,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Now isn't the time to be discussing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.35,0:09:28.90,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,More importantly, that's an \Namusing idea you just proposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:32.48,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Kissing Mio once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.62,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I plan to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:38.89,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You already failed \Nto seal her once, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:41.27,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Do you have any chance of succeeding this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:50.14,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Is that Mio's true desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:56.91,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Are you saying that's the reason \Nshe turned all of us into Spirits?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:09:58.11,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:00.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm fairly certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.17,0:10:04.62,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:18.47,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,There's no means of escape \Nonce we're trapped in this space, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:22.40,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,And since Mio shares your memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:26.45,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,she should be able to stop Zaphkiel's \Nability to travel back in time as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:28.05,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Which means
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.05,0:10:32.77,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,we'll need to bet on the possibility \Nwith the greatest chances for survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:36.61,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I've done this much for you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.61,0:10:39.15,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Now be sure you see this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:40.51,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:42.70,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:58.80,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,My, my, you've become \Nawfully good at this, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.49,0:11:00.74,Main - Italics,Shido,0,0,0,,My body feels light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:03.51,Main - Italics,Shido,0,0,0,,My entire body is brimming with power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:10.06,Main - Italics,Shido,0,0,0,,I see. Now I truly have the power \Nof all 10 Sephirah within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.53,0:11:12.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Now I can pull this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:13.56,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:33.58,Main,Spirits,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:34.17,Main,Spirits,0,0,0,,Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:35.34,Main - Top,Spirits,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:35.34,Main,Spirits,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:35.34,Main - Top,Spirits,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:47.42,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.15,0:11:50.10,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.14,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:12:01.95,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,So that is what it feels like to have \Na Qlipha yanked out while still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:05.37,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,That was a valuable experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:07.95,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Is this any time for jokes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:10.12,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,What's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.57,0:12:14.61,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,It seems Nightmare has entrusted \Nher power to Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.61,0:12:16.06,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,And Goetia?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:18.79,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,It's still next to Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:21.00,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Remote control hasn't been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.63,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:27.67,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Then all is going smoothly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.34,0:12:31.26,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:33.54,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.37,0:12:37.58,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Yes, I wasn't injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:39.35,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I just hit my time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:40.78,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.25,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.25,0:12:46.91,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Perplexed. What is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:50.53,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Kotori, Shido is safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.53,0:12:51.93,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:55.23,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido wouldn't go down \Nfrom something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:57.43,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:58.79,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Nia, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:01.69,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Bring the monitoring equipment here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:03.22,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(190,82)\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H6C8193&\3c&HF4FCF8&}Analyzing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:03.80,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(190,82)\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H6C8193&\3c&HF4FCF8&}Complete
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:06.42,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Mmn, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:07.79,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:13.14,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Nia, please leave this part to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:14.31,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Kurumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:15.99,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Raziel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:20.25,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,That's possible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:21.69,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,I mean, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:26.17,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,I guess it would be after that villainous \Npresident took my Sephirah, but still-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.17,0:13:27.70,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.06,0:13:32.95,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's my first time using this Angel, \Nso please let me focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.95,0:13:36.29,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Ngh, I'm getting NTR'd?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.29,0:13:38.71,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,So humiliating!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:41.51,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Can you tell how Shido's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:42.46,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.97,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It seems he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:49.37,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:21.59,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.93,0:14:23.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:24.25,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:27.42,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,R-Reine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:29.70,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:31.21,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:32.97,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Where's Fraxinus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.75,0:14:34.72,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:35.50,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:37.82,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:45.31,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:48.36,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Hey! Here, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.69,0:14:49.42,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.89,0:14:51.91,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.94,0:14:53.74,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,And...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:03.69,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,M-Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:07.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:08.72,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.55,0:15:10.39,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:13.49,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Shinji Takamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:14.29,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:19.33,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I guess I should say nice to meet you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:28.97,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:33.63,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It would seem to be a space created by Ein Sof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:36.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,It seems to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:41.06,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,There's a connection between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:46.29,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It seems like our shared memories \Nare being recreated through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.15,0:15:51.81,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,In doing so, I think it separated our minds \Ninto me and Mio plus you and Shin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:58.33,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,in order to create a state \Nmore closely resembling those memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:00.77,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I-I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.60,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Isn't this kind of thing nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:04.40,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,More importantly, let's have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:06.41,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Since we're at the beach and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:30.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You've done it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:33.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:54.40,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Are you losing the sense that you were Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:57.93,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?! Can you read my mind in this space?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:16:59.55,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,That wasn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:03.21,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I just figured you were like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:04.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:09.52,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I suppose the emotions I held as Mio \Nmight have gone into that Mio
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:12.42,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,when our existences were separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:15.63,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It's a strange feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:23.57,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It really feels like I'm Reine Murasame, \Na separate person from Mio Takamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:27.65,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:31.70,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It really feels nice, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:36.89,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I should thank you for bringing me here, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:39.03,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you're enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:43.65,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I worked pretty hard to find \Na place with nice scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.31,0:17:47.26,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.11,0:17:49.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:53.86,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Oh, I wanted to try that! Those fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:56.17,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You have to light fireworks \Nwhen you visit the beach, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:18:00.80,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,We were home by evening last time \Nwe came here, so we couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.80,0:18:02.78,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I-I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:06.22,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,We had to leave by then \Nor it would've gotten too late,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:08.06,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,and we would've worried Mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:10.36,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,as well as give people the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:14.81,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That just means there's more fun \Nto be had in the future, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:17.69,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to try diving and having a barbecue, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.69,0:18:20.35,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Let's try out lots and lots more things?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:25.37,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be fun with you, \Nme, Reine, and Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:33.15,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I honestly wish this time could last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:37.82,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:41.95,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But nothing lasts forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:45.27,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.99,0:18:48.75,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:51.55,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.37,0:18:55.05,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I made you say that, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.99,0:19:09.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,When I first kissed Reine, \Nyour memories as Mio flowed into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:13.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I couldn't understand what they were,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:16.25,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,and I didn't understand what they meant,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:18.42,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:22.45,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Now I finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:25.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:31.31,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:37.13,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You gave birth to me in order to \Nbring the dead Shinji back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:39.19,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:43.29,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But that wasn't all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:49.08,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Because you knew the Shinji created \Nthat way wouldn't be the real Shinji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:55.07,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you were \Nconscious of it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.77,0:19:59.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,but after seeing your memories, \NI learned something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:07.79,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio, you gave birth to me \Nto create a being that could kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.23,0:20:17.85,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,How is it, Kurumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:26.99,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,On the shore there's Shido, Mio, \NMs. Murasame, and another Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:30.41,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Hmm? Did you say there are two of Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:32.25,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:35.54,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Also, Mio and Reine are separated?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:40.21,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Suspicious. Was that cocoon \Ncapable of reproduction?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:43.65,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I won't know without looking into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:46.14,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Why did they end up like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:52.41,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:54.28,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,An extremely strong spirit wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:55.76,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,But where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.76,0:20:57.02,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Everyone, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:01.88,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:02.82,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:05.54,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,They're definitely plotting something!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:06.78,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,I'll go eliminate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.53,0:21:09.53,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:18.92,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.25,0:21:21.61,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,The spell has already been activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:23.32,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:24.67,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Looks like this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:29.95,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Yes, I believed in you, Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:35.18,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I knew you would surely stop Deus for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.39,0:21:45.70,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Rejoice, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:52.33,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,You all get to witness the birth \Nof a second Spirit of Origin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.00,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.333,185.466)}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.00,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an8\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.866,280.399)}A Fleeting Paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:40.02,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\blur3\shad1\fs20\pos(604,310)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3D3D3D&\shad0\3a&H60&}Episode 12: {\fscx93}"And The One She Chooses Is"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:28.42,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,The time to settle things has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.42,0:23:33.19,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,What conclusion will the love \Nbetween Shinji, Mio, and Shido lead to?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.51,0:23:36.68,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,The final episode, \N"And The One She Chooses Is".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.68,0:23:39.68,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Now, let's head out on our last date.
